                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa kana ogwa Yehoyakimu mutabani wa Yosiya omukama wa Yuda, MUKAMA akagambira Yeremiya ekigambo kinu ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwata omuzingo gw'ekitabu, oguhandiikemu ebigambo byona ebi nakugambiire hali Isirairi, Yuda na ha mahanga goona, okurugirra ha kiro eki nabaliizeeho na iwe okubanza. Omu biro bya Yosiya okuhika hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju ya Yuda rundi kakuba eraahurra akabi ako koona akandukuteekereza kubakora, buli muntu akacwa engeso ze embi, nanyowe nubwo nsobora kubaganyira obubi bwabo n'ekibi kyabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya nukwo kweta Bbaruki mutabani wa Neriya, Bbaruki yahandiika ebigambo byona MUKAMA ebi yagambiire Yeremiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya yagambira Bbaruki ati, tindukwikirizibwa kutaaha omunju ya mukama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habweki, iwe wenka ogende kandi ha kiro eky'okusiiba, ebigambo bya MUKAMA ebi nakuragiire wabihandiika ha muzingo gw'ekitabu obisomere omunju ya MUKAMA, abantu boona bategere amatu. Kandi obisomere abantu ba Yuda abaliruga omu mbuga zaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA, rundi araahurra okwesengereza kwabo, buli muntu nukwo acwe engeso ze embi, habwokuba MUKAMA, akahayira abantu banu akwasirwe muno ekiniga, kandi abiihiriirwe kimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bbaruki mutabani wa Neriya akakora byona Yeremiya omurangi ebiyamuragiire, yasoma ebigambo bya MUKAMA, omunju ya MUKAMA, naabiiha ha muzingo gw'ekitabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa kataano ogwa Yekoyakimu mutabani wa Yosiya omukama wa Yuda, omu kwezi okwa mwenda, abantu boona abakaba bali Yerusaalemu, n'abantu boona abaarugire omu mbuga za Yuda baija Yerusaalemu, bakarangirra ekisiibo omumaiso ga MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bbaruki yasoma ebigambo bya Yeremiya, omunju ya MUKAMA, omu kisiika kya Gemaliya mutabani wa Safani omuhandiiki, ekikaba kiri omu zigati ey'eruguru, ha mulyango ogw'Irembo Erihyaka ery'Enju ya MUKAMA, naabiiha ha muzingo gw'ekitabu abantu boona bahunzire amatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaaya mutabani wa Gemaliya mwijukuru wa Safani, obu yahuliire ebigambo bya MUKAMA byona ebyasomerwe ha muzingo gw'ekitabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yasirimuka ha Nju ya MUKAMA, yataaha omu kisiika ky'omuhandiiki abanyoro boona nuho bakaba baikaliire: Erisaana omuhandiiki Delaaya mutabani wa Semaaya, Elinasani mutabani w'Akiboora, Gemaliya mutabani wa Safani, Zedekiya mutabani wa Hananiya n'abanyoro boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaaya, byona ebi yahuliire Bbaruki naasomera abantu, yabibagambira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyoro boona nubwo baatumire Yehudi mutabani wa Nesaniya mwijukuru wa Seremiya mutabani wa Kimasi, agambire Yeremiya ati, “Kwata omuzingo gw'ekitabu ogu osomiire abantu, oije nagwo.” Bbaruki mutabani wa Neriya nukwo kukwata omuzingo gw'empapura yabahikaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamugambira bati, “Ikarra ogusome.” Na Bbaruki yagubasomera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baahuliire ebigambo byona, baakubuutukirangana bakwasirwe obutiini; baagambira Bbaruki bati, “Ebigambo binu byona, kituhikiriire kubigambira omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma baakaguza Bbaruki bati, “Tugambire ebigambo binu byona okabihandiika ota? Yeremiya akabikusomera?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bbaruki yabagarukamu ati “Ebigambo ebi byona yabingambiraga, nyowe nimbihandiika na bwino, ha muzingo gw'ekitabu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma abanyoro baagambira Bbaruki bati, iwe na Yeremiya, “mugende mwesereke, hatabaho omuntu amanya nambere muli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baamazire kuta omuzingo gw'ekitabu omu kisiika ky'Erisaama omuhandiiki, baataaha omu kikaali, baahikaho omukama, bamusoborra ebi byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nubwo yatumire Yehudi atabarre omuzingo gw'empapura; yagwiha omu kisiika ky'Erisaama omuhandiiki; yagusomera omukama, n'abanyoro boona abakaba bali haihi omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukaba kuli kwezi kwa mwenda, kandi omukama akaba asingire omu karuziika ei yaikaramuga omu busumi bw'obutiti, omumaiso ge, haroho omurro nigwaka ha kiswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehudi obu yakamaraga kusoma enkarra isatu rundi ina, Omukama nazisara ha muzingo nazinaga omu murro. Kinu akaikara naakikora kuhika omuzingo gwona obu gwahoireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omukama rundi abamu ha baheereza be abaahuliire ebigambo ebi byona, batatiine kandi batatemule byokujwara byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisani, Delaaya na Gemaliya, noobu baayesengeriize muno omukama aleke kwokya omuzingo gw'ekitabu, atabahurre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaragira Yeremeeri mutabani w'omukama, na Seraiya mutabani w'Azirieli, na Seremiya mutabani w'Abudeeri; bakwate Bbaruki omuhandiiki, na Yeremiya omurangi, baitu MUKAMA yabasereka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama obu yamazire kwokya omuzingo gw'ekitabu oguroho ebigambo, Bbaruki ebiyahandiikire naabigambirwa Yeremiya, MUKAMA akagambira Yeremiya ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwata omuzingo gw'empapura ogundi, ohandiike ebigambo byona ebyahandiikirwe ha muzingo ogw'okubanza, ogwayokiibwe Yehoyakimu omukama wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu omukama wa Yuda, omugambire oti, ‘MUKAMA naagamba ati, oyokeze omuzingo gw'ekitabu kinu, noogamba oti, “Kiki ekyakikuhandiikisizeemu noogamba oti, mananukwo omukama wa Bbabbulooni aliija ahwerekereze ensi enu, atemateme abantu n'ebisoro abamalemu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, Yehoyakimu omukama wa Yuda, MUKAMA naamugambaho ati: Talitunga muntu ow'aliikarra ha kitebe ky'obukama ekya Daudi kandi omutumbi gwe omu bwire bwa nyamusana gulihungurwa aheeru guteerwe omusana, kandi omu bwire bw'ekiro gunagwe omumbeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndimufubira n'oruzaaro rwe n'abaheereza be, habw'obubi bwabo; bbo, abasi ba Yerusaalemu n'abantu ba Yuda, akabi aka nahayire kubaleetera baayanga kuhurra. Ndikabaleetera.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya nubwo yakwasire omuzingo ogundi, yaguha Bbaruki omuhandiiki mutabani wa Neriya, yaguhandiikaho ebigambo byona Yeremiya ebiyamugambiraga ebikaba biri ha muzingo, Yehoyakimu omukama wa Yuda ogu yayokeze omu murro; kandi hali biri, hakongerwaaho ebigambo bingi ebirukusisana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
